OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter what is shaping up to be the
OL,7,Fhottest, driest summer on record, this
OL,8,Fweek saw the return of that wet stuff
OL,9,Ffalling from the sky.
OL,11,FBut our Weather Watchers were still out
OL,12,Facross the thirsty landscapes of the
OL,13,FNorth East and Cumbria.
OL,15,FHere are our top picks of where they
OL,16,Fcaught the rain - and rainbows.
